Package: com.group.readreceipt
Name: Group Read Receipt
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: internal
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.7100)
Description: Standalone group read receipt for Turrit
 Independent dylib that implements group read receipts without Lead JS sandbox.
 Hooks native Objective-C methods, reports dwell-based read events to a
 self-hosted Node/SQLite backend. Private chat and channels are disabled.
